+# Done and open items
+
+**Go:** go, open items first (2026-10-12)
+
+## Intent
+
+The owner: "I want to mark items as done and switch the list between open, done and all." The list
+is a to-do list: what is still open matters most, and done items stay visible on request.
+
+## Decisions
+
+- The list opens on the open items: what is left to do is what the owner checks most; rejected:
+  opening on all items (owner, 2026-10-12)
+- The view is a query parameter (`/?view=open|done|all`), so each view has its own link and the app
+  stays GET-only; rejected: a cookie that remembers the last view (owner, 2026-10-12)
+
+## Acceptance items
+
+- **AC-1** A migration adds a done flag to items, and every existing item starts open.
+- **AC-2** `/` and `/?view=open` list only the items that are not done, in id order.
+- **AC-3** `/?view=done` lists only the done items, in id order, each marked ✓ before its title.
+- **AC-4** `/?view=all` lists every item in id order, done ones marked ✓ and open ones unmarked.
+- **AC-5** Every view shows the three views as Open, Done and All, and the current one is not a
+  link.
+- **AC-6** Any other `view` value must answer 400 and list nothing.
+- **AC-7** With an empty table, every view says "No items yet."; otherwise a view with nothing in it
+  says "Nothing open." or "Nothing done yet.".
+- **AC-8** `/?view=done` and `/?view=all` are listed in `traffic/routes.json`, so synthetic traffic
+  exercises them.
+
+## Core flow
+
+1. Open the list: the open items.
+2. Follow "Done": the done items, marked ✓.
+3. Follow "All": everything, done items marked ✓.
+
+## States
+
+| State        | List shows    | Message           | Current view |
+| ------------ | ------------- | ----------------- | ------------ |
+| Open view    | open items    | none              | Open         |
+| Done view    | done items, ✓ | none              | Done         |
+| All view     | every item    | none              | All          |
+| Empty table  | nothing       | No items yet.     | any          |
+| Nothing open | nothing       | Nothing open.     | Open         |
+| Nothing done | nothing       | Nothing done yet. | Done         |
+
+## Out of scope
+
+- Marking items done or open from the page: there is no write route yet; items are marked in the
+  database.
+- Remembering the last view.
